==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 96% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 3~8 seconds<sup>90f~240f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]]. Summon [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]] to stop One Horn's quick attacks, but be prepared to upgrade your wallet as killing the One Horns gives you lots of money.

If you are stuck on this level, you can cheese it by using [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]] along with one meatshield. Use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] to kill the first [[One Horn]] that spawns, and since Squire Rel is the boss in this level, you could [[Knockback|knockback]] the One Horns back to the enemy base and then destroy the base.

It is even possible only using [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]], Pirate Cat and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] and by using the [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] [[Cat Combo|Combo]]. You could also use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] to kill the first One Horn, or to knockback the One Horns if you don't have Pirate Cat.

